    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Pairs of (PaxDate, ISO LocalDate) that represent the same day. Used to verify that {@code PaxChronology.dateEpochDay} correctly converts an ISO epoch-day back to the matching Pax date. Groups: - Year 1 early days (normal month boundary) - Year 6 leap year: months 13 (Pax) and 14 crossing Dec boundary - Year 7 first day - Years 399-401 around a century-level boundary - Year 0 last days - Historical spot-checks (1582, 1945, 2012) - Negative years (BCE)"
